Subject: Cantor M2B Pure Stream Information Parser Justification

& [JustificationIdentity] is traceable
  + [justification_uuid] is 9aacf697-3bba-4f1d-a789-ec4890e37f28

& [Reason] is unsafe-seam reduction
  + the future platform seam can copy one bounded returned region and delegate all variable-chain interpretation to safe pure Rust
  + malformed offsets, lengths, sizes, UTF-16, and termination can be exhausted in memory without creating adversarial filesystem objects
  + parser success remains deliberately weaker than physical enumeration or topology admission

& [Rollback] is remove one module, export, and tests with no state migration
